/conf.researchr.org/room/issta-2025/issta-2025-venue-cosmos-3c\" class=\"room-link navigate\">Cosmos 3C</a></strong> - <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/track/issta-2025/issta-2025-papers#program\" class=\"navigate\">Test Automation, Evolution, and API Testing</a> <small>Chair(s): <a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/profile/issta-2025/alexiturcotte\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"navigate\">Alexi Turcotte</a></small><div class=\"text-muted\">Info for room <strong>Cosmos 3C</strong>: </div><blockquote class=\"info-participants\"><p>Cosmos 3C is the third room in the Cosmos 3 wing.</p>\n<p>When facing the main Cosmos Hall, access to the Cosmos 3 wing is on the left, close to the stairs. The area is accessed through a large door with the number \u201C3\u201D, which will stay open during the event.</p>\n</blockquote></div></div></div></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/issta-2025/issta-2025-papers/86/Effective-REST-APIs-Testing-with-Error-Message-Analysis\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-5ea1f0fe-4c50-4b17-b55b-99e465ff9ae1').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
